Backport: vo_libmpv: don't steal pointer provided by the API user
Origin: https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv/commit/6f619d5ef43b070d728e43f0b2fe0571449de1a8
Upstream-Date: 2024-08-06
Applied-to: mpv 0.38.0
Modified-by: ChengYingPlayer maintainers, 2026-09-17

This is the complete upstream fix: copy borrowed ICC bytes at the public API
boundary, remove the now-redundant internal macOS copy, and retain its API note.
Only documentation hunk context is adapted to the 0.38.0 release tarball.
The public libmpv ABI version remains unchanged by this backport.

--- a/DOCS/client-api-changes.rst
+++ b/DOCS/client-api-changes.rst
@@ -32,5 +32,9 @@ API changes
 
 ::
+ --- mpv 0.39.0 ---
+ 2.4    - mpv_render_param with the MPV_RENDER_PARAM_ICC_PROFILE argument no
+          longer has incorrect assumptions about memory allocation and can be
+          correctly used.
  --- mpv 0.38.0 ---
  2.3    - partially revert the changes from API version 1.27, remove libmpv as
           the default VO and move it to the bottom of the auto-probing order.
